program	errors/static_lend_var.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	cannot take mutable reference `&var` to static `X`: statics are immutable
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: cannot take mutable reference `&var` to static `X`: statics are immutable"
log	"  --> examples/errors/static_lend_var.saw:10:20"
log	"     |"
log	" 10 | func main() { bump(&var X) }"
log	"     |                    ^"
log	"   hint: pass `&X` for a shared read, use an interior-synchronized type (`Atomic<Int>`, `SpinLock<T>`), or declare it `unsafe static var`"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
